{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": true,\n  \"problems\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"五条解释形成了连贯且有层次的因果链：此前近乎毫无保留的投入仍未消除不确定性，但真实经历过的快乐使他能够在急切退下后继续享受亲近；紧张转成直接欢喜，兴奋反复抬高，随后对时间流逝的觉察使留恋出现，最后的骤停又带来短暂空落。S08-B1、B2、B3均有具体去处，所谓独立保留也不是回避解释，因为明朗、轻快与玩心已被总体的自在欢喜涵盖，而对方实际回应的读法被合理排除。所依赖的历史均有此前的听感解释，理由没有依靠未经确立的外部事件或关系变化；选中文字也与候选原话一致，局部解释各自对应不同的时间变化，没有明显多余的心理步骤或空泛理由。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "16a66fb6-f27e-43e4-9752-d34d02aa2b1b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T070105980054Z", "elapsed_seconds": 291.344, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T07:05:57.335073+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ecd0f11d21b77589aae0cffdf09f84da1ed6f16a47131248e06e03d1c889098", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee5